, "x1": 0.46813186813186813, "y1": 0.6332556332556333}, {"text": "\u00a9 Boyd said, \u201cshifty = f(x) two units to the left then reflect that in the y\u2014axis.\u201d", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.6449106449106449, "x1": 0.8208791208791208, "y1": 0.662004662004662}, {"text": "\u00a9 Virginia said, \u201cshift y= f(x) two units to the right then reflect that in the line x=2.\u201d", "x0": 0.15274725274725276, "y0": 0.6736596736596736, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.6899766899766899}, {"text": "\u00a9 Graham said, \u2018\u201c\u2018just reflect y = f(x) in the line x =1.\u201d", "x0": 0.15274725274725276, "y0": 0.7031857031857032, "x1": 0.610989010989011, "y1": 0.717948717948718}, {"text": "Who was correct?", "x0": 0.15274725274725276, "y0": 0.7319347319347319, "x1": 0.2967032967032967, "y1": 0.7428127428127428}, {"text": "(A) Nobody", "x0": 0.16813186813186815, "y0": 0.7668997668997669, "x1": 0.2934065934065934, "y1": 0.7808857808857809}, {"text": "(B) Only Boyd", "x0": 0.16813186813186815, "y0": 0.7995337995337995, "x1": 0.31868131868131866, "y1": 0.8135198135198135}, {"text": "(\u00a9) Boyd and Virginia", "x0": 0.16813186813186815, "y0": 0.8313908313908314, "x1": 0.3791208791208791, "y1": 0.8461538461538461}, {"text": "(D) Boyd, Virginia and Graham", "x0": 0.16813186813186815, "y0": 0.864024864024864, "x1": 0.45384615384615384, "y1": 0.8787878787878788}, {"text": "End of Section I", "x0": 0.44065934065934065, "y0": 0.8997668997668997, "x1": 0.5747252747252747, "y1": 0.9098679098679099}], [{"text": "Section II", "x0": 0.1, "y0": 0.07226107226107226, "x1": 0.2230769230769231, "y1": 0.08702408702408702}, {"text": "Attempt Questions 11 to 16.", "x0": 0.0989010989010989, "y0": 0.11033411033411034, "x1": 0.3362637362637363, "y1": 0.12432012432012432}, {"text": "All questions are of equal value.", "x0": 0.1, "y0": 0.1351981351981352, "x1": 0.37142857142857144, "y1": 0.14840714840714841}, {"text": "Answer each question ina SEPARATE writing booklet. Extra writi